    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-09-14T16:22:31.602Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":1},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_is-your-business-ready-for-investment-what-activity-7505299957583863808-IBge","text":"Is Your Business Ready for Investment? What Barbadian Entrepreneurs Need to Know.\n\nRead more about how we can shift the Raising Capital conversation here: https://lnkd.in/es3Mjgf7) \n\nLet’s continue building stronger, investment-ready Barbadian businesses. 🇧🇧","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_is-your-business-ready-for-investment-what-activity-7505299957583863808-IBge"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-09-11T11:43:14.380Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":5},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-investmentready-activity-7504142509262958593-xgGF","text":"🚀 Are you ready to take your business to the next level?\n\nFollowing the fantastic turnout for our first session, the Barbados Stock Exchange is pleased to announce the second of four Online Clinics for 2026/27.\n\nThis session will explore what investors look for and how growth-stage businesses can strengthen their financials, governance and documentation to become investment-ready.\n\nJoin us for what promises to be another practical and insightful session.\n\n#BarbadosStockExchange #InvestmentReady #BusinessGrowth #AccessToCapital #Entrepreneurship","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-investmentready-activity-7504142509262958593-xgGF"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-09-11T11:30:49.839Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":53},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-caribbeanstrategicadvisors-activity-7504139386477862912-5ATd","text":"When growing enterprises in the Caribbean need expansion capital, commercial bank debt isn't the only route.\n\nSpeaking with Rawdon Adams and Mark Hassell of Caribbean Strategic Advisors, we discussed why growing companies should look toward equity capital on the Barbados Stock Exchange (BSE).\n\nKey Takeaways:\n- Permanent Balance Sheet Support: Equity funding strengthens financial health without rigid, ongoing interest repayments during slow periods.\n- Tailored for SMEs: The Innovation & Growth Market (IGM) gives mid-sized businesses an affordable path to public capital.\n- Positioned for Expansion: Equity financing provides the exact runway needed to scale capacity or execute regional distribution plans.\n- How are you evaluating your capital mix for future growth?\n\n📌 Explore listing opportunities at bse.com.bb\n\n#BarbadosStockExchange #CaribbeanStrategicAdvisors #EquityCapital #SMEGrowth #IGM #CorporateStrategy #CaribbeanBusiness","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-caribbeanstrategicadvisors-activity-7504139386477862912-5ATd"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-07-29T16:03:56.249Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":3},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_national-hero-international-icon-we-activity-7488263049900908544-PH8f","text":"National Hero🔱 | International Icon🏏\n\nWe salute you, Sir Garry. \n\nThank you for clearing the path, for batting away the obstacles. From the pitch to the perch, your enduring leadership - from the very inception of Independence - has allowed Barbados to continue 'not out' as the Gem of the Caribbean, and beyond ✨🇧🇧.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_national-hero-international-icon-we-activity-7488263049900908544-PH8f"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-07-22T16:11:33.435Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":34},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-smegrowth-capitalmarkets-activity-7485728252305633280-NVVR","text":"For local business owners and entrepreneurs, the biggest hurdle to scaling isn't a lack of vision—it's a lack of sustainable capital. 🇧🇧\n\nMany SMEs hit a growth ceiling relying solely on rigid bank funding, hesitating to explore capital markets out of fear of losing independence. But listing your business isn't a corporate takeover—it's a strategic partnership with your community.\n\nThrough frameworks like the BSE’s Innovation and Growth Market (IGM), you can invite public investment to unlock scale, acquire equipment, and expand—all while maintaining full corporate control and protecting your legacy. ⚖️🏢\n\nWant to hear more from Terry?\n\n🗓️ Tune in tomorrow (Thursday, July 23) at 9:00 AM AST to learn how the BSE can work for you.\n\n🔗 Register here: https://lnkd.in/eFncdbER \n\n#BarbadosStockExchange #SMEGrowth #CapitalMarkets #InvestInBarbados #BajanSMEs #BarbadosBusiness","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-smegrowth-capitalmarkets-activity-7485728252305633280-NVVR"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-07-22T11:04:42.616Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":6},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-barbados-investbarbados-activity-7485651031767523328-dj6e","text":"🚀 Ready to discover what the Barbados Stock Exchange can do for you?\n\nWhether you're an entrepreneur looking to grow your business, an SME exploring new funding options, or someone interested in investing for the future, this free online session is for you.\n\nIn just one hour, you'll discover:\n\n✅ How the Barbados Stock Exchange works\n✅ How businesses raise capital through equity financing\n✅ Investment opportunities available in Barbados\n✅ How to navigate the market with greater confidence\n\n🎟️ Reserve your free place today:\nhttps://lnkd.in/eFncdbER\n\nJoin us for our first BSE 2026/27 Online Clinic\n\n📈 The BSE & You\n📅 Thursday, 23 July 2026\n🕘 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM\n\nKnow someone who could benefit? Tag them below or share this post to help more Barbadians discover the opportunities available through the Barbados Stock Exchange.\n\n🎟️ Reserve your free place today:\nhttps://lnkd.in/eFncdbER 🇧🇧\n\n#BarbadosStockExchange #Barbados #InvestBarbados #TheBSEAndYou #EquityFinancing #InvestmentReady #BusinessGrowth #Entrepreneurship #SMEs #CapitalMarkets #BSEOnlineClinic #BSELearningSeries","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_barbadosstockexchange-barbados-investbarbados-activity-7485651031767523328-dj6e"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-07-20T16:57:19.222Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":4},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_ready-to-discover-what-the-barbados-stock-activity-7485014993231482880-_ACF","text":"🚀 Ready to discover what the Barbados Stock Exchange can do for you?\n\nWhether you're an entrepreneur looking to grow your business, an SME exploring new funding options, or someone interested in investing for the future, this free online session is for you.\n\nJoin us for our first BSE 2026/27 Online Clinic:\n📈 The BSE & You\n📅 Thursday, 23 July 2026\n🕘 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM\n\nIn this interactive session you'll discover:\n✅ How the Barbados Stock Exchange works\n✅ How businesses raise capital through equity financing\n✅ Investment opportunities available in Barbados\n✅ How to navigate the market with greater confidence\n\n🎟️ Reserve your place today:\nhttps://lnkd.in/eFncdbER \n\nKnow someone who could benefit? Tag them below or share this post. Together, let's build a stronger culture of investment and business growth in Barbados. 🇧🇧","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_ready-to-discover-what-the-barbados-stock-activity-7485014993231482880-_ACF"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-07-20T14:33:02.741Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":17},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_financialliteracy-financialempowerment-activity-7484978685318623232-JYEb","text":"Mentorship. Community. Financial Empowerment. 🤝👓📈\n\nOn May 29th, the BSE was proud to partner with I Am A Girl NGO to conduct an engaging workshop on financial literacy. \n\nThis. Event. Was. Transformative. ✨👧🏽👧🏾👧🏼✨\n\nLeading the morning’s ‘Market Moves’ session was Ms. Felicia Marshall – the BSE’s Senior Systems Administrator and go-to specialist on all things technology. Felicia was surgical in explaining the capital market: not only on how it works, but also how it could work for the young ladies in the room. \n\nRounding out support for the event were representatives from the stock brokerage institutions in Barbados – this workshop was deeply enriching and a rewarding success for all involved!\n.\n.\n.\n#financialliteracy #financialempowerment #mentorship #girlpower #BarbadosStockExchange","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_financialliteracy-financialempowerment-activity-7484978685318623232-JYEb"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-07-01T12:01:41.940Z","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":17},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_corporategovernance-businessgrowth-manufacturing-activity-7478055228236435457-EoJf","text":"Legacy doesn't equal stagnation. 📈\n\nWhen an iconic brand reaches a certain age, the temptation is often to play it safe. But as Managing Director Jonathon Hart points out following Roberts Manufacturing's recent listing on the Barbados Stock Exchange, true long-term value requires a willingness to evolve.\n\nBy opening up to public governance and transitioning from a legacy operation into a transparent, market-listed entity, they aren't just protecting their 80+ year history—they are securing the capital and accountability needed to target the global Caribbean diaspora in the US, UK, and Canada.\n\nThe Strategic Takeaway for Leaders:\nGoing public or scaling up isn't about giving up control. It’s about building a structured, disciplined foundation that allows your business to survive the next century.\n\nHow is your organization challenging its own legacy to prepare for future growth? Let’s discuss below. 👇\n\n#CorporateGovernance #BusinessGrowth #Manufacturing #CaribbeanBusiness #CapitalMarkets","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_corporategovernance-businessgrowth-manufacturing-activity-7478055228236435457-EoJf"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"SocialMediaPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-"},"datePublished":"2026-06-28T11:30:26.436Z","headline":"Trust & Fund Services Officer – Technical & Regulatory Compliance","interactionStatistic":{"@type":"InteractionCounter","interactionType":"http://schema.org/LikeAction","userInteractionCount":5},"mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_hiring-activity-7476960198193098752-lQJ5","text":"We're #hiring a new Trust & Fund Services Officer – Technical & Regulatory Compliance in Bridgetown, Saint Michael. Apply today or share this post with your network.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-_hiring-activity-7476960198193098752-lQJ5"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","url":"https://bb.linkedin.com/company/barbados-stock-exchange-inc-","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"8th Avenue","addressLocality":"Belleville","addressRegion":"St. Michael","postalCode":"BB11114","addressCountry":"BB"},"description":"The Barbados Stock Exchange is one of the leading stock exchanges in the Caribbean region. It is located in Barbados, a quality destination that is trusted and well regulated which follows international best practice in capital market regulation. It has a well established democracy with a long tradition of respecting the rule of law and property rights. It has excellent infrastructure and possesses many competitive advantages making it a premier location globally for international business and financial services.\r\n\r\nThe original trading facility, known as the Securities Exchange of Barbados, was established in 1987 under the Securities Exchange Act, Cap 318A, of 1982. The original Act of 1982 was then repealed and replaced by the Securities Act 2001-13.\r\n\r\nOn August 2, 2001 with the passage of the Securities Act 2001-13 the Securities Exchange of Barbados, through re-incorporation, evolved into the Barbados Stock Exchange (BSE). The passage of this Act also enabled the establishment of the Securities Commission, which on April 1st, 2011 was subsumed by the Financial Services Commission (FSC). The FSC is responsible for regulation of the Insurance sub-sector, Co-operative and Non-banking Financial sectors and the entire Barbados Capital Market, including Self-Regulatory Organization and public companies whether listed or not.\r\n \r\nThe Barbados Stock Exchange Inc. is a member of the World Federation of Exchanges with Correspondent Status.\r\n\r\nOur Vision\r\nTo be a great and lasting Caribbean Institution by facilitating wealth creation through trading on an efficient and cost-effective Exchange.\r\n\r\nOur Mission\r\nWe intend, through education, to foster an environment of confidence and trust in the activities of the capital markets, so that all Barbadians would participate in the trading of financial instruments.","numberOfEmployees":{"value":25,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQGn3XiNq1alxA/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1630475765772/barbados_stock_exchange_inc__logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=zy8nrLEU2bfyXrV8wBMxLQyurGxNfGtvXKgZ9iUL7Hk","description":"Barbados Stock Exchange Inc.","@type":"ImageObject"},"slogan":"Dream Big. Take Stock.","sameAs":"http://www.bse.com.bb"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
