  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🚀 Are you ready to take your business to the next level?

Following the fantastic turnout for our first session, the Barbados Stock Exchange is pleased to announce the second of four Online Clinics for 2026/27.

This session will explore what investors look for and how growth-stage businesses can strengthen their financials, governance and documentation to become investment-ready.

Join us for what promises to be another practical and insightful session.

